<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Mazel prices at top of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Mazel prices at top of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Mazel Stores Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At			     $16</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $14-16</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		    2.574 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter WM Blair</p>
<p>NOTE: The number of shares and the estimated pricing range were previously raised to 2.574 million shares in a range of $14 to $16 per share from 2.145 million shares in a range of $13 to $15 per share.</p>
<p>The company is based in Solon, Ohio.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
